{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"title":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents29OUDSCircularProgressIndicatorV","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A circular indicator shows the progress of a task using a circle.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Useful when you need more visual focus or when space is limited.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"content":[{"text":"Variants","type":"heading","anchor":"Variants","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two variants are provided:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"code":"[0, 1]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Statuses","type":"heading","anchor":"Statuses","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Gap size","type":"heading","anchor":"Gap-size","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Track","type":"heading","anchor":"Track","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Animation (determinate mode only)","type":"heading","anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flag.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator()","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)"]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“75 percent”","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait so that assistive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"technologies know the value is changing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}]},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic "},{"code":".isStaticText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"trait is used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver ("},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Colored surfaces","type":"heading","anchor":"Colored-surfaces","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", the indicator switches to a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the "},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]},{"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering","level":2},{"text":"Orange","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Orange"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Sosh","type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Sosh","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Wireframe"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A circular progress indicator component in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"title":"Components","type